OPTIONS:
  -v, --version           Print the version.
  -h, --help              Show help.

SUBCOMMANDS:
  list                    List notes, narrowed by location or one tag.
  search                  Find notes with the search query language.
  cat                     Print a note's text.
  show                    Print a note's metadata.
  outline                 Show a note's sections, each with its address.
  search-in               Find a string inside one note.
  create                  Create a note.
  append                  Add text to a note or to one of its sections.
  edit                    Replace, insert or delete exact text in a note.
  overwrite               Replace a note's text, or one section of it.
  tags                    Work with tags.
  attachments             Work with a note's attachments.
  pin                     Work with pins.
  trash                   Send a note to the trash.
